{"seq":4,"slug":"instruction-tuning","title":"指令微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/instruction-tuning","wordCount":984,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"指令微调\">指令微调</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>指令微调把「文本补全器」改造成「对话助手」，围绕以下概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>指令微调（Instruction Tuning）</strong>：在指令-回答数据对上做监督微调，让模型学会理解并遵循指令。</li>\n<li><strong>SFT 损失掩码</strong>：只在助手回答部分计算损失，系统提示与用户指令作为上下文但不参与梯度更新。</li>\n<li><strong>指令数据集</strong>：Alpaca、ShareGPT、FLAN 等，规模从 52K 到 1.8M 不等；质量比数量更重要。</li>\n<li><strong>Chat 模板</strong>：定义多轮对话的拼接格式（ChatML、LLaMA 3、Mistral 各不相同），是训练与推理必须一致的对齐点。</li>\n<li><strong>系统提示</strong>：定义角色、行为约束与输出格式，且必须在训练阶段就纳入，否则推理时的遵循能力会大打折扣。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话串起来：<strong>SFT 决定「学会听指令」，掩码决定「在哪里学」，数据集与模板决定「按什么格式学」，系统提示决定「按什么角色学」。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"从语言模型到对话助手\">从语言模型到对话助手</h2><p>预训练后的语言模型虽然具备强大的语言能力，但它本质上只是一个文本补全器——给它一段文字，它续写下去。指令微调（Instruction Tuning）通过在指令-回答数据对上进行监督微调（SFT），让模型学会理解并遵循人类指令。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;文本补全器&quot;] --&gt;|SFT| B[&quot;指令微调模型&lt;br/&gt;对话助手&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|RLHF/DPO| C[&quot;对齐模型&lt;br/&gt;安全可控&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"预训练模型&lt;br/&gt;文本补全器\"] --&gt;|SFT| B[\"指令微调模型&lt;br/&gt;对话助手\"]\n    B --&gt;|RLHF/DPO| C[\"对齐模型&lt;br/&gt;安全可控\"]</pre><p>指令微调前后的行为对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>预训练模型输出</th>\n<th>指令微调后输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&quot;解释什么是 API&quot;</td>\n<td>&quot;是一个缩写词...&quot; (百科续写)</td>\n<td>&quot;API 是应用程序编程接口，它定义了...&quot; (结构化解答)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;把这段文字翻译成英文&quot;</td>\n<td>可能继续写中文</td>\n<td>正确执行翻译任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&quot;写一首关于春天的诗&quot;</td>\n<td>随机续写</td>\n<td>创作一首主题明确的诗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"sft-训练过程\">SFT 训练过程</h2><p>监督微调（Supervised Fine-Tuning）在指令数据集上用标准的交叉熵损失进行训练。关键区别是：<strong>只在回答部分计算损失，指令部分作为上下文但不参与损失计算</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;import torch.nn.functional as F&#10;&#10;def sft_loss_with_mask(logits, labels, loss_mask):&#10;    shift_logits = logits[..., :-1, :].contiguous()&#10;    shift_labels = labels[..., 1:].contiguous()&#10;    shift_mask = loss_mask[..., 1:].contiguous()&#10;&#10;    loss = F.cross_entropy(&#10;        shift_logits.view(-1, shift_logits.size(-1)),&#10;        shift_labels.view(-1),&#10;        reduction=&#39;none&#39;&#10;    )&#10;    loss = (loss * shift_mask.view(-1)).sum() / shift_mask.sum()&#10;    return loss&#10;&#10;batch_size, seq_len, vocab_size = 2, 20, 32000&#10;logits = torch.randn(batch_size, seq_len, vocab_size)&#10;labels = torch.randint(0, vocab_size, (batch_size, seq_len))&#10;loss_mask = torch.zeros(batch_size, seq_len)&#10;loss_mask[:, 10:] = 1.0&#10;&#10;loss = sft_loss_with_mask(logits, labels, loss_mask)&#10;print(f&quot;SFT 损失（仅回答部分）: {loss.item():.4f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.functional </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sft_loss_with_mask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logits, labels, loss_mask):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shift_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logits[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, :].contiguous()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shift_labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> labels[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:].contiguous()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    shift_mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss_mask[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:].contiguous()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        shift_logits.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, shift_logits.size(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        shift_labels.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">        reduction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shift_mask.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).sum() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> shift_mask.sum()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> loss</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">batch_size, seq_len, vocab_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randn(batch_size, seq_len, vocab_size)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">labels </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.randint(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, vocab_size, (batch_size, seq_len))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss_mask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.zeros(batch_size, seq_len)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss_mask[:, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sft_loss_with_mask(logits, labels, loss_mask)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SFT 损失（仅回答部分）: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">loss.item()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.4f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 训练序列&#10;        direction LR&#10;        S[[系统提示]&quot;] --&gt; U[[用户指令]&quot;]&#10;        U --&gt; A[[助手回答]&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    S -.-&gt;|&quot;不计算损失&quot;| X1[&quot;mask = 0&quot;]&#10;    U -.-&gt;|&quot;不计算损失&quot;| X2[&quot;mask = 0&quot;]&#10;    A -.-&gt;|&quot;计算损失&quot;| X3[&quot;mask = 1&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 训练序列\n        direction LR\n        S[[系统提示]\"] --&gt; U[[用户指令]\"]\n        U --&gt; A[[助手回答]\"]\n    end\n    S -.-&gt;|\"不计算损失\"| X1[\"mask = 0\"]\n    U -.-&gt;|\"不计算损失\"| X2[\"mask = 0\"]\n    A -.-&gt;|\"计算损失\"| X3[\"mask = 1\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"指令数据集\">指令数据集</h2><p>高质量的指令数据集是 SFT 成功的关键。数据集通常包含多样化的任务类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据集</th>\n<th>规模</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Alpaca</td>\n<td>52K</td>\n<td>GPT-3.5 生成</td>\n<td>Stanford</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ShareGPT</td>\n<td>~90K</td>\n<td>真实用户对话</td>\n<td>社区收集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FLAN</td>\n<td>~1.8M</td>\n<td>多任务混合</td>\n<td>Google</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenAssistant</td>\n<td>~160K</td>\n<td>人类标注多轮对话</td>\n<td>LAION</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UltraChat</td>\n<td>~1.5M</td>\n<td>高质量合成对话</td>\n<td>清华</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"sft_example = {&#10;    &quot;messages&quot;: [&#10;        {&#10;            &quot;role&quot;: &quot;system&quot;,&#10;            &quot;content&quot;: &quot;你是一个乐于助人的 AI 助手。&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;            &quot;role&quot;: &quot;user&quot;,&#10;            &quot;content&quot;: &quot;请解释什么是梯度下降?&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        {&#10;            &quot;role&quot;: &quot;assistant&quot;,&#10;            &quot;content&quot;: &quot;梯度下降是一种常用的优化算法，它通过计算损失函数对参数的梯度，&quot;&#10;                       &quot;沿着梯度的反方向更新参数，从而逐步最小化损失函数。&quot;&#10;                       &quot;你可以把它想象成在山坡上蒙着眼睛，&quot;&#10;                       &quot;通过感受脚下的坡度来寻找最低点。&quot;&#10;        }&#10;    ]&#10;}&#10;&#10;for msg in sft_example[&quot;messages&quot;]:&#10;    print(f&quot;[{msg[&#39;role&#39;]}] {msg[&#39;content&#39;][:50]}...&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sft_example </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"system\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是一个乐于助人的 AI 助手。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"请解释什么是梯度下降?\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"assistant\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"content\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"梯度下降是一种常用的优化算法，它通过计算损失函数对参数的梯度，\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                       \"沿着梯度的反方向更新参数，从而逐步最小化损失函数。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                       \"你可以把它想象成在山坡上蒙着眼睛，\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">                       \"通过感受脚下的坡度来寻找最低点。\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> msg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sft_example[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"messages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'role'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">] </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'content'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">...\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 研究表明，SFT 数据的质量比数量更重要。LIMA 论文用仅 1,000 条精选数据就训练出了表现优异的模型，证明了&quot;少而精&quot;的价值。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"chat-模板\">Chat 模板</h2><p>不同模型使用不同的聊天模板（Chat Template）来组织多轮对话。模板定义了系统提示、用户消息和助手回复的格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"templates = {&#10;    &quot;ChatML (Qwen)&quot;: (&#10;        &quot;&lt;|im_start|&gt;system\\n你是一个助手&lt;|im_end|&gt;\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;&lt;|im_start|&gt;user\\n你好&lt;|im_end|&gt;\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;&lt;|im_start|&gt;assistant\\n&quot;&#10;    ),&#10;    &quot;LLaMA 3&quot;: (&#10;        &quot;&lt;|begin_of_text|&gt;&lt;|start_header_id|&gt;system&lt;|end_header_id|&gt;\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;你是一个助手&lt;|eot_id|&gt;&quot;&#10;        &quot;&lt;|start_header_id|&gt;user&lt;|end_header_id|&gt;\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;你好&lt;|eot_id|&gt;&quot;&#10;        &quot;&lt;|start_header_id|&gt;assistant&lt;|end_header_id|&gt;\\n&quot;&#10;    ),&#10;    &quot;Mistral&quot;: (&#10;        &quot;&lt;s&gt;[INST] 你好 [/INST]&quot;&#10;    ),&#10;}&#10;&#10;for name, tpl in templates.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;--- {name} ---&quot;)&#10;    print(tpl)&#10;    print()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">templates </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"ChatML (Qwen)\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;|im_start|>system</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">你是一个助手&#x3C;|im_end|></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;|im_start|>user</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">你好&#x3C;|im_end|></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;|im_start|>assistant</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"LLaMA 3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;|begin_of_text|>&#x3C;|start_header_id|>system&#x3C;|end_header_id|></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"你是一个助手&#x3C;|eot_id|>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;|start_header_id|>user&#x3C;|end_header_id|></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"你好&#x3C;|eot_id|>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;|start_header_id|>assistant&#x3C;|end_header_id|></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Mistral\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"&#x3C;s>[INST] 你好 [/INST]\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, tpl </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> templates.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"--- </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ---\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(tpl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>模板格式</th>\n<th>支持系统提示</th>\n<th>特殊 token</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Qwen</td>\n<td>ChatML</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>&lt;|im_start|&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;|im_end|&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LLaMA 3</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td><code>&lt;|begin_of_text|&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;|eot_id|&gt;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mistral</td>\n<td>[INST]</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td><code>[INST]</code>, <code>[/INST]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek</td>\n<td>ChatML</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>同 Qwen</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"系统提示\">系统提示</h2><p>系统提示（System Prompt）是指令微调中的重要组成部分，它定义了模型的角色、行为约束和输出格式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    SP[&quot;系统提示&quot;] --&gt; Role[&quot;角色定义&lt;br/&gt;你是一个专业的数据分析师&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; Rules[&quot;行为规则&lt;br/&gt;始终用中文回答&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; Format[&quot;输出格式&lt;br/&gt;用 Markdown 表格呈现&quot;]&#10;    SP --&gt; Safety[&quot;安全约束&lt;br/&gt;不提供医疗诊断&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n    SP[\"系统提示\"] --&gt; Role[\"角色定义&lt;br/&gt;你是一个专业的数据分析师\"]\n    SP --&gt; Rules[\"行为规则&lt;br/&gt;始终用中文回答\"]\n    SP --&gt; Format[\"输出格式&lt;br/&gt;用 Markdown 表格呈现\"]\n    SP --&gt; Safety[\"安全约束&lt;br/&gt;不提供医疗诊断\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"system_prompts = {&#10;    &quot;通用助手&quot;: &quot;你是一个乐于助人的 AI 助手。请用简洁、准确的方式回答问题。&quot;,&#10;    &quot;代码助手&quot;: (&#10;        &quot;你是一个高级编程助手。遵循以下规则：\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;1. 优先使用 Python 编写代码\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;2. 代码必须包含类型注解\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;3. 提供简要的代码注释\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;4. 如果有多种方案，列出优缺点&quot;&#10;    ),&#10;    &quot;安全助手&quot;: (&#10;        &quot;你是一个遵守安全准则的 AI 助手。\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;- 不提供任何有害、非法或不道德的内容\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;- 对不确定的信息明确标注\\n&quot;&#10;        &quot;- 拒绝执行越权操作&quot;&#10;    ),&#10;}&#10;&#10;for role, prompt in system_prompts.items():&#10;    print(f&quot;[{role}]\\n{prompt}\\n&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">system_prompts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"通用助手\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"你是一个乐于助人的 AI 助手。请用简洁、准确的方式回答问题。\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"代码助手\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"你是一个高级编程助手。遵循以下规则：</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"1. 优先使用 Python 编写代码</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"2. 代码必须包含类型注解</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"3. 提供简要的代码注释</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"4. 如果有多种方案，列出优缺点\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"安全助手\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"你是一个遵守安全准则的 AI 助手。</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"- 不提供任何有害、非法或不道德的内容</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"- 对不确定的信息明确标注</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"- 拒绝执行越权操作\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> role, prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> system_prompts.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">role</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prompt</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 系统提示的效果在指令微调阶段就需要被纳入训练。如果训练数据中没有包含系统提示，模型在推理时对系统提示的遵循能力会大打折扣。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>指令微调（SFT）是将预训练模型转变为对话助手的关键步骤。</li>\n<li>SFT 只在回答部分计算损失，指令部分作为上下文但不参与梯度更新。</li>\n<li>数据质量比数量更重要，少量高质量数据可以取得优异效果。</li>\n<li>Chat 模板定义了多轮对话的格式，不同模型使用不同的模板标准。</li>\n<li>系统提示在训练阶段就需要被纳入，以确保模型在推理时能有效遵循。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"指令微调","id":"指令微调"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从语言模型到对话助手","id":"从语言模型到对话助手"},{"level":2,"text":"SFT 训练过程","id":"sft-训练过程"},{"level":2,"text":"指令数据集","id":"指令数据集"},{"level":2,"text":"Chat 模板","id":"chat-模板"},{"level":2,"text":"系统提示","id":"系统提示"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"RLHF 与对齐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/rlhf-and-alignment"},"next":{"title":"全量微调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/fine-tuning/full-fine-tuning"}}